WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2


3
00:00.052 --> 00:01.422
I’m here just to take my man back.

4
00:01.756 --> 00:02.988
I don’t want to pick a fight.

5
00:03.239 --> 00:04.600
Are you accepting me into your gang?

6
00:04.679 --> 00:06.091
You told him you came to take your man back.

7
00:06.215 --> 00:07.880
Doesn’t it mean that I’m your henchman?

8
00:08.170 --> 00:10.960
When I said my man, I didn’t mean that you were my henchman.

9
00:11.489 --> 00:13.320
Does anyone want to play chess against Zeng?

10
00:14.926 --> 00:15.718
Check.

11
00:16.528 --> 00:17.840
I’m here to admit that I lost.

12
00:18.046 --> 00:18.774
Forget it.

13
00:18.854 --> 00:19.680
It’s just the past.

14
00:19.768 --> 00:21.192
I have my pride.

15
00:21.794 --> 00:22.880
I gave you my word.

16
00:23.219 --> 00:24.215
I won’t change it.

17
00:25.040 --> 00:27.520
Ah-woo.

18
00:51.678 --> 00:52.678
Dad.

19
00:54.968 --> 00:56.680
Can you tell Yong to come home?

20
01:01.329 --> 01:02.680
I’m worried about him.

21
01:16.415 --> 01:18.435
Who’s that? Hey, Stop!

22
01:21.807 --> 01:22.698
Hey.

23
01:23.210 --> 01:23.976
Stop.

24
01:24.001 --> 01:24.751
Stop.

25
01:31.146 --> 01:32.146
Catch them.

26
01:34.110 --> 01:34.920
Run!

27
02:10.596 --> 02:11.480
Zeng!

28
02:42.540 --> 02:43.572
Who do you run with?

29
02:44.013 --> 02:45.009
I won’t tell you.

30
02:45.181 --> 02:46.800
-I’m asking you, who do you run with? -Let me go.

31
03:24.804 --> 03:29.043
(Next time, I’ll rip your teeth out. Tot, you pathetic loser.)

32
03:29.700 --> 03:30.700
Dumbass!

33
04:45.240 --> 04:46.188
HONGSEN GARAGE

34
04:46.217 --> 04:47.680
Forty-three.

35
04:52.111 --> 04:52.920
Check.

36
04:56.787 --> 04:57.787
Damn it.

37
04:57.892 --> 04:58.752
You lost again.

38
04:58.919 --> 04:59.910
Want to play another game?

39
05:00.720 --> 05:01.670
What about you, Aod?

40
05:01.695 --> 05:02.483
No.

41
05:02.593 --> 05:03.400
Sen.

42
05:03.449 --> 05:04.556
Do you want to play a game with me?

43
05:06.984 --> 05:07.984
Can I?

44
05:08.361 --> 05:10.000
Can I play a game with you?

45
05:10.361 --> 05:12.928
Yeah. You should play with him.

46
05:12.953 --> 05:13.953
Come on.

47
05:23.688 --> 05:24.688
Blackjack.

48
05:25.150 --> 05:26.240
I won.

49
05:26.741 --> 05:30.000
Come on. Give me the money.

50
05:30.053 --> 05:31.440
I got a face card. Damn it.

51
05:31.591 --> 05:32.324
Next hand.

52
05:32.349 --> 05:33.856
Here’s your nuts.

53
05:36.937 --> 05:38.280
I’m craving snacks to eat.

54
05:38.305 --> 05:39.104
Here, Ton.

55
05:39.143 --> 05:40.060
Here, Piak.

56
05:40.116 --> 05:41.500
Den, these are your watermelon seeds.

57
05:46.355 --> 05:47.399
I’m going to practice shooting.

58
05:47.605 --> 05:49.440
Kla and Aod, if you want to join me, come.

59
06:17.818 --> 06:19.480
If you can’t handle it, you should go home.

60
06:23.104 --> 06:24.200
I can handle everything.

61
06:26.605 --> 06:28.163
It’s just a bit harder with Den.

62
06:28.188 --> 06:29.600
It means you can’t handle him.

63
06:33.768 --> 06:34.960
Who said I can’t do it?

64
06:35.985 --> 06:37.240
Don’t assume things.

65
06:38.019 --> 06:39.019
Do I?

66
06:40.002 --> 06:42.480
I’ll earn Den’s acceptance.

67
06:43.229 --> 06:44.229
How?

68
06:45.487 --> 06:46.838
I don’t know yet. But I know I can do it.

69
06:51.001 --> 06:52.500
For the bus fare back to Phra Nakorn.

70
06:55.181 --> 06:56.400
I told you I won’t go back.

71
06:59.116 --> 07:01.680
When you want to go back, just tell me.

72
07:03.107 --> 07:04.328
I’ll give you the bus fare.

73
07:08.193 --> 07:09.193
Sen.

74
07:11.510 --> 07:12.760
You want me to go back.

75
07:13.699 --> 07:15.304
Because you don’t want to help me with my mom, right?

76
07:16.779 --> 07:18.480
If you can’t keep your word,

77
07:19.662 --> 07:20.854
don’t make up an excuse.

78
07:23.223 --> 07:25.600
When you can make everyone in the gang accept you,

79
07:26.123 --> 07:27.721
then you can talk to me about promises.

80
07:52.542 --> 07:53.542
Den.

81
07:54.816 --> 07:55.816
Den.

82
07:59.039 --> 08:00.640
Why do you hate me? Just tell me.

83
08:00.770 --> 08:03.342
Everyone accepts me into the gang, except you.

84
08:03.367 --> 08:04.396
What is your problem?

85
08:07.697 --> 08:08.960
I don’t hate you.

86
08:11.134 --> 08:13.040
What do you have to earn my acceptance?

87
08:16.024 --> 08:17.120
What do you want me to do?

88
08:17.466 --> 08:18.466
Tell me.

89
08:23.384 --> 08:25.200
Compete against me in a shooting match.

90
08:26.601 --> 08:29.160
If you win, I’ll accept you.

91
08:38.742 --> 08:39.956
If you fail to hit the target,

92
08:41.840 --> 08:43.080
you must leave the gang.

93
08:49.869 --> 08:50.869
Fine.

94
08:51.499 --> 08:52.640
Just set the date.

95
09:13.859 --> 09:14.859
Din.

96
09:15.072 --> 09:16.510
Did Ton find a new man to help us?

97
09:16.604 --> 09:17.880
We won’t finish it before the ship arrives.

98
09:18.505 --> 09:20.040
Ton joined Tot’s gang.

99
09:21.803 --> 09:22.560
Hurry up.

100
09:22.577 --> 09:23.560
What about Keng?

101
09:23.647 --> 09:25.160
Where is he? Go get him.

102
09:25.872 --> 09:27.449
Keng left with Ton.

103
09:28.650 --> 09:29.693
What did you say?

104
09:30.026 --> 09:32.000
Keng and Ton joined Tot’s gang.

105
09:33.093 --> 09:34.093
Hurry up.

106
09:47.019 --> 09:48.139
F*ck you, Tot!

107
09:48.548 --> 09:49.640
He’s a douchebag.

108
09:49.768 --> 09:50.558
Asshole.

109
09:50.590 --> 09:51.720
Bastard.

110
09:52.769 --> 09:53.769
Dickhead.

111
09:54.743 --> 09:55.783
That’s right.

112
09:56.294 --> 09:58.000
Tot is always provoking us.

113
09:58.049 --> 09:59.640
We need to teach him a lesson.

114
09:59.737 --> 10:02.634
Yes, if we don’t do anything, people will say that our gang is a loser.

115
10:02.719 --> 10:04.160
We need to beat him up.

116
10:05.683 --> 10:07.520
I will make him pay for it.

117
10:07.956 --> 10:10.000
But right now, we need to solve the problem first.

118
10:10.419 --> 10:11.680
A big ship is coming in.

119
10:12.028 --> 10:14.883
If we can’t load the cargo onto the ship in time, everyone will take a hit.

120
10:15.059 --> 10:17.560
I agree. Your responsibility should come first.

121
10:19.116 --> 10:19.949
It’s none of your f*cking business.

122
10:20.000 --> 10:21.360
Are you messing with my boss?

123
10:22.047 --> 10:23.047
Din, Kheow.

124
10:24.059 --> 10:25.059
Sit down.

125
10:26.203 --> 10:27.524
Don’t pay attention to the temple boy.

126
10:34.210 --> 10:37.360
You two, go spread the word.

127
10:38.033 --> 10:42.240
Zeng Klookfoon Gang is recruiting new members.

128
10:42.678 --> 10:47.240
I’m looking for capable men to work for me.

129
10:47.819 --> 10:48.819
Go.

130
10:49.142 --> 10:50.560
Yes, boss.

131
10:53.454 --> 10:54.454
Go.

132
10:55.026 --> 10:55.732
Let’s go.

133
10:55.757 --> 10:56.480
Go.

134
10:56.581 --> 10:57.400
Come on.

135
11:03.254 --> 11:04.360
What the hell are you looking at?

136
11:06.027 --> 11:08.080
Nothing.

137
11:29.395 --> 11:30.395
Sen.

138
11:33.341 --> 11:34.341
Sen.

139
11:37.714 --> 11:38.831
What do you want?

140
11:38.970 --> 11:40.410
Den challenges me to a shooting match.

141
11:41.038 --> 11:43.280
Kla told me that only you and Den have a gun.

142
11:44.582 --> 11:45.810
Can I borrow your gun to practice?

143
11:47.333 --> 11:48.326
You will waste my bullets.

144
11:48.404 --> 11:50.084
Are you undermining me?

145
11:50.747 --> 11:52.800
Won’t you give me a chance to prove myself?

146
11:58.166 --> 11:59.227
You can never beat him.

147
11:59.344 --> 12:00.400
Don’t underestimate me.

148
12:01.119 --> 12:03.240
If I practice hard, I’m sure I can beat him.

149
12:05.195 --> 12:06.195
You?

150
12:08.213 --> 12:09.360
Just wait and see.

151
12:09.622 --> 12:11.280
I’ll show you that I can beat Den.

152
12:11.523 --> 12:12.520
Let me borrow it.

153
12:14.913 --> 12:16.240
I threw it away a long time ago.

154
13:06.961 --> 13:08.360
Great.

155
13:10.442 --> 13:11.640
You slipped up, Sen.

156
13:13.870 --> 13:14.870
Amazing.

157
13:18.461 --> 13:19.960
Didn’t you say you threw it away?

158
13:22.121 --> 13:23.480
Did you go into my room?

159
13:24.470 --> 13:25.800
If I’m going to lose to Den,

160
13:26.764 --> 13:28.440
at least I want to do my best.

161
13:28.718 --> 13:29.600
Yong!

162
13:29.757 --> 13:30.757
Hey.

163
13:56.853 --> 13:58.208
If you can reassemble it,

164
13:59.330 --> 14:00.320
you can take it.

165
14:01.360 --> 14:03.120
I will also teach you how to shoot.

166
14:18.843 --> 14:19.883
Hit it, boss.

167
14:33.171 --> 14:34.171
Done.

168
14:38.314 --> 14:40.560
You shouldn’t underestimate anyone you don’t know well.

169
15:05.067 --> 15:06.880
Are you feeling tired?

170
15:07.078 --> 15:08.078
Yes.

171
15:12.584 --> 15:13.468
But I’m feeling much better.

172
15:13.613 --> 15:15.560
Because you met me?

173
15:22.743 --> 15:23.960
Is that your friend?

174
15:26.173 --> 15:30.440
Do you think I would hang out with him?

175
15:32.063 --> 15:33.320
Oh, come on.

176
15:35.602 --> 15:36.602
Let’s drink.

177
15:36.742 --> 15:37.480
Yes.

178
15:37.505 --> 15:38.505
Hey.

179
15:39.232 --> 15:40.232
What’s up?

180
15:41.569 --> 15:43.000
Why do I always run into you?

181
15:43.133 --> 15:44.133
Maybe…

182
15:45.213 --> 15:46.573
it’s our destiny.

183
15:47.477 --> 15:48.320
Ptuh!

184
15:48.454 --> 15:49.560
It’s more like a curse.

185
15:54.108 --> 15:55.360
What are you looking at?

186
15:57.256 --> 16:00.960
Can anyone ever take their eyes off you?

187
16:01.530 --> 16:04.400
Then keep looking at me. Don’t take your eyes off me.

188
16:04.948 --> 16:07.760
Sure, I will look only at you tonight.

189
16:10.978 --> 16:12.360
This is my first time at the bar.

190
16:13.000 --> 16:15.560
Don’t forget to ask for me next time.

191
16:15.775 --> 16:16.609
Sure.

192
16:46.666 --> 16:49.280
If I can’t have her, you won’t get her either.

193
16:51.148 --> 16:52.148
Come here.

194
16:57.844 --> 16:58.889
Are you daring me?

195
17:01.536 --> 17:02.576
Hey, asshole.

196
17:08.686 --> 17:09.686
Hey.

197
17:11.878 --> 17:13.080
You think you’re so tough?

198
17:13.630 --> 17:15.680
I’m tougher than you.

199
17:16.320 --> 17:18.120
Ouch, ouch.

200
17:20.494 --> 17:21.640
Do you want to try me?

201
17:23.619 --> 17:24.619
Bring it on.

202
18:17.443 --> 18:19.480
Drink it, drink it.

203
18:24.410 --> 18:26.229
-Bottoms up, bottoms up! -Bottoms up, bottoms up!

204
18:31.097 --> 18:32.320
You’re such a wimp.

205
18:33.547 --> 18:34.480
Are you sure?

206
18:35.529 --> 18:36.440
Give it to me.

207
18:41.214 --> 18:44.440
Drink it, drink it, drink it.

208
18:53.723 --> 18:55.240
Can’t keep up, loser?

209
19:00.830 --> 19:02.646
No, you are a loser, asshole.

210
19:06.057 --> 19:07.080
You are two shots behind me.

211
19:07.781 --> 19:08.691
I’m keeping track of it.

212
19:08.713 --> 19:10.120
What the f*ck!

213
19:11.393 --> 19:12.656
Why did you hit me?

214
19:12.817 --> 19:13.817
Huh?

215
19:16.400 --> 19:18.400
Here. Hit me here too.

216
19:20.200 --> 19:22.760
Good. Now, it’s balanced.

217
19:23.353 --> 19:24.473
Give it to me.

218
19:24.573 --> 19:25.366
Hey.

219
19:25.391 --> 19:26.391
What?

220
19:27.048 --> 19:28.048
It’s mine.

221
19:29.780 --> 19:31.758
You said I’m two shots behind you.

222
19:32.187 --> 19:35.141
Don’t act like that jerk, Tot—that thief.

223
19:41.643 --> 19:42.593
I’m not a thief.

224
19:42.618 --> 19:43.898
You are a thief.

225
19:44.394 --> 19:48.120
Go. Join Tot and Damding Gang.

226
19:48.797 --> 19:50.080
You’re good at stealing.

227
19:50.254 --> 19:53.367
You stole my stuff, my men,

228
19:53.864 --> 19:55.400
and now my booze.

229
19:55.573 --> 19:56.800
It’s because you are a wimp.

230
19:57.393 --> 19:59.160
Instead of throwing a tantrum here,

231
19:59.530 --> 20:02.240
if I were you, I would go there and beat him up.

232
20:02.443 --> 20:04.903
Don’t dare me. Do you think I won’t do it?

233
20:06.588 --> 20:07.588
Do you dare do it?

234
20:07.644 --> 20:08.644
Yes.

235
20:09.787 --> 20:11.800
If you dare, then let’s go.

236
20:11.852 --> 20:13.800
Yes, I will go.

237
20:14.132 --> 20:14.932
-Go. -Let’s go.

238
20:15.013 --> 20:15.615
Go.

239
20:15.640 --> 20:19.000
I’ll show you that Zeng Klookfoon is not a wimp.

240
20:19.212 --> 20:19.960
Let’s go.

241
20:21.728 --> 20:23.040
Walk forward.

242
20:24.667 --> 20:26.200
Why is the door so far?

243
20:26.594 --> 20:27.594
Ouch.

244
20:29.358 --> 20:30.358
Calm down.

245
20:30.673 --> 20:32.200
Let’s deal with the boss.

246
20:32.422 --> 20:34.928
Let’s go beat Tot. Go!

247
20:48.993 --> 20:50.793
You betrayed your own boss.

248
20:50.879 --> 20:52.040
You are worse than a dog.

249
20:54.014 --> 20:55.360
You’re like a vagrant dog.

250
20:57.786 --> 20:59.640
Why would I want to keep you?

251
21:00.110 --> 21:01.440
I will never betray you.

252
21:03.677 --> 21:04.792
How can I trust you?

253
21:04.817 --> 21:05.670
Please don’t kill me.

254
21:05.695 --> 21:06.695
Hey.

255
21:11.959 --> 21:13.000
Who the hell are you?

256
21:13.309 --> 21:14.509
I’m your daddy.

257
21:28.610 --> 21:30.960
Calm down.

258
21:32.123 --> 21:33.200
Do you want to get killed?

259
21:37.229 --> 21:39.120
I’ll pee on you all.

260
21:40.243 --> 21:41.243
Asshole!

261
22:22.182 --> 22:23.360
The cop is here.

262
22:23.793 --> 22:24.812
Who called them?

263
22:24.837 --> 22:25.837
I did.

264
22:35.609 --> 22:36.411
Zoe.

265
22:41.591 --> 22:43.000
Come on. Let’s go.

266
22:47.588 --> 22:48.960
This felt so damn good.

267
22:49.002 --> 22:51.485
You’re a bastard. You really peed on him.

268
22:51.600 --> 22:52.840
You’re a bastard.

269
22:53.222 --> 22:54.262
You, jackass.

270
22:55.763 --> 22:56.680
You, scumbag.

271
22:58.478 --> 22:59.400
Zoe!

272
23:10.299 --> 23:11.320
What water is this?

273
23:13.303 --> 23:14.160
Hey.

274
23:22.648 --> 23:23.995
Zoe, wake up.

275
23:25.536 --> 23:26.536
What?

276
23:33.241 --> 23:35.200
Zeng. You should leave.

277
23:54.133 --> 23:55.133
Your turn.

278
23:55.480 --> 23:56.600
What’s your name?

279
23:57.283 --> 23:58.283
Wan Jiap.

280
23:58.390 --> 23:59.390
Go.

281
24:02.834 --> 24:05.640
Hey, Zeng. Why are you so late?

282
24:07.680 --> 24:10.080
Hello, Zeng.

283
24:12.818 --> 24:14.240
Where have you been all night?

284
24:14.937 --> 24:16.240
Did you have a great time?

285
24:17.637 --> 24:20.000
Kind of.

286
24:21.658 --> 24:24.400
What are these men doing here?

287
24:24.518 --> 24:25.518
What?

288
24:26.139 --> 24:28.360
You said you’re recruiting new members.

289
24:28.793 --> 24:30.120
They are here for that.

290
24:31.962 --> 24:33.760
Everyone wants to work for you.

291
24:34.879 --> 24:36.618
Look.

292
24:38.040 --> 24:39.820
The last one, Chui.

293
24:42.250 --> 24:43.498
-Are you Chui? -Yes.

294
24:43.589 --> 24:44.459
How old are you?

295
24:44.484 --> 24:45.484
29.

296
24:45.823 --> 24:46.853
Are you unemployed?

297
24:47.777 --> 24:48.777
Go, go.

298
24:48.803 --> 24:50.000
Is this the last one?

299
24:50.674 --> 24:52.000
Get ready.

300
24:52.130 --> 24:53.200
The evaluation will begin soon.

301
24:59.446 --> 25:00.446
Wait.

302
25:01.844 --> 25:02.844
Wait for me.

303
25:05.398 --> 25:06.563
What the hell are you doing here?

304
25:08.214 --> 25:09.880
Go away. We are closed.

305
25:12.083 --> 25:13.400
You can close the application.

306
25:13.752 --> 25:15.000
I already applied.

307
25:15.958 --> 25:16.958
When?

308
25:23.004 --> 25:29.560
I, Zeng Klookfoon, accepted Zoe Temple Boy’s application.

309
25:32.770 --> 25:33.770
What?

310
25:34.122 --> 25:35.960
Don’t you remember last night?

311
25:50.481 --> 25:53.120
Zeng, I’m sorry.

312
25:53.900 --> 25:55.760
I crashed your bike.

313
25:56.669 --> 25:59.520
Your riding skills suck.

314
25:59.887 --> 26:01.000
Forget it.

315
26:02.098 --> 26:03.617
I’ve got to go.

316
26:03.679 --> 26:05.677
Wait. Stay with me.

317
26:05.702 --> 26:07.120
I can’t be late.

318
26:07.497 --> 26:09.177
I’m the gang’s leader.

319
26:09.202 --> 26:10.200
You are breaking my neck.

320
26:10.347 --> 26:15.206
I, Zeng Klookfoon, accept, Zoe…

321
26:17.006 --> 26:19.400
Zoe Temple Boy’s application.

322
26:21.169 --> 26:22.080
My words are sacred.

323
26:22.552 --> 26:23.880
There’s only paper here.

324
26:24.674 --> 26:26.240
Where can I find a pencil?

325
26:26.451 --> 26:27.480
Is there one here?

326
26:28.004 --> 26:29.004
I have it.

327
26:29.897 --> 26:31.017
You are weird.

328
26:31.516 --> 26:34.400
I accept Zoe Temple Boy…

329
26:41.803 --> 26:43.560
Damn it.

330
26:55.548 --> 26:56.548
Here.

331
27:01.498 --> 27:04.160
When you point the gun, keep your finger off the trigger.

332
27:05.013 --> 27:06.177
Yong, your finger.

333
27:06.202 --> 27:07.202
I forgot.

334
27:08.099 --> 27:09.920
Hold it with both hands.

335
27:10.131 --> 27:10.960
Yeah.

336
27:11.583 --> 27:12.837
Why are your legs so close together?

337
27:13.122 --> 27:14.160
Are you afraid that your balls will fall?

338
27:14.226 --> 27:15.029
Spread them apart.

339
27:15.054 --> 27:16.028
Just a little.

340
27:17.836 --> 27:18.914
Your shoulders are not straight.

341
27:18.939 --> 27:19.826
Keep them straight.

342
27:20.625 --> 27:22.640
Keep the front and rear sights aligned.

343
27:22.731 --> 27:23.560
Look straight.

344
27:23.601 --> 27:24.801
Open your eyes.

345
27:25.303 --> 27:26.303
Aim.

346
27:33.089 --> 27:34.040
What are you looking at?

347
27:34.353 --> 27:35.398
Look at the target.

348
27:39.958 --> 27:42.600
Wow, amazing.

349
28:45.711 --> 28:46.711
Don’t worry.

350
28:47.596 --> 28:50.240
You missed the target because your left arm was not straight.

351
28:50.949 --> 28:53.080
You need to keep both arms straight.

352
28:54.304 --> 28:56.440
Keep the front and rear sights aligned.

353
29:17.139 --> 29:18.400
Yong!

354
29:20.451 --> 29:21.760
Where is your focus?

355
29:22.664 --> 29:24.206
What would you do if it hit someone?

356
29:27.006 --> 29:28.006
I’m sorry.

357
29:34.682 --> 29:36.040
I’m so aching.

358
29:40.071 --> 29:41.480
You know how to assemble a gun.

359
29:42.360 --> 29:43.760
Why don’t you know how to shoot?

360
29:46.359 --> 29:48.160
I often watched my dad do it.

361
29:48.419 --> 29:50.000
So I followed what he did.

362
29:52.023 --> 29:53.680
It’s just technical skills.

363
29:54.484 --> 29:56.280
It’s different from shooting someone.

364
30:00.250 --> 30:03.520
You are surely a rich kid, not a gangster, Yong.

365
30:08.677 --> 30:10.320
You are a real gangster.

366
30:11.382 --> 30:12.710
Have you shot many people?

367
30:17.904 --> 30:19.480
Why did you hide your gun?

368
30:21.890 --> 30:23.520
Why did you tell me you threw it away?

369
30:47.205 --> 30:51.280
Now you know how to use a gun. You should use it well.

370
30:52.086 --> 30:53.440
Don’t shoot anyone.

371
30:55.619 --> 30:57.160
I won’t shoot anyone.

372
30:58.182 --> 31:00.080
I just want Den to accept me.

373
31:01.045 --> 31:02.600
So I can stay here without worries.

374
31:20.295 --> 31:21.295
Why?

375
31:23.739 --> 31:24.739
It stinks.

376
31:25.717 --> 31:26.717
It stinks?

377
31:30.208 --> 31:33.000
If you want to work for me, you need to endure it.

378
31:35.293 --> 31:36.293
Let me go.

379
31:37.580 --> 31:39.713
You are surely a rich kid, Yong.

380
32:33.332 --> 32:34.332
Yes, boss.

381
32:36.987 --> 32:38.187
Spread my legs?

382
32:40.307 --> 32:41.720
The front and rear sights.

383
32:43.670 --> 32:44.670
-Yes. -Hey.

384
32:50.764 --> 32:52.120
I am spreading my legs.

385
32:54.402 --> 32:55.402
I’m sorry.

386
32:56.164 --> 32:57.164
Yong.

387
32:58.555 --> 32:59.555
Hey.

388
33:17.864 --> 33:19.544
Can’t I rest a little?

389
33:24.382 --> 33:26.062
The last match for today.

390
33:27.146 --> 33:28.346
Zoe Temple Boy…

391
33:32.422 --> 33:35.400
…versus Yak!

392
34:20.063 --> 34:21.343
Can’t handle it?

393
34:48.326 --> 34:49.520
That’s all you got.

394
35:04.373 --> 35:07.717
Yak, Yak, Yak, Yak.

395
35:30.999 --> 35:31.999
Yak.

396
35:32.620 --> 35:33.640
Hit him in the head.

397
35:41.739 --> 35:43.520
Come on. Get up.

398
35:59.320 --> 36:03.600
Zoe, Zoe, Zoe, Zoe.

399
36:22.320 --> 36:25.104
The members of Zeng Klookfoon are not afraid to die.

400
36:25.623 --> 36:27.303
The five of you, pair up.

401
36:28.300 --> 36:29.300
Come on.

402
36:35.361 --> 36:38.240
Russian Roulette, you know it, right?

403
36:38.867 --> 36:41.440
Five chances of survival, one chance of death.

404
36:41.905 --> 36:45.200
The last man standing will join our gang.

405
36:49.508 --> 36:50.680
There’s one bullet.

406
36:52.907 --> 36:55.480
If you are scared, you can step out now.

407
36:58.534 --> 36:59.574
They pair up.

408
37:00.474 --> 37:01.720
These two pair up.

409
37:04.002 --> 37:05.122
What about me?

410
37:05.524 --> 37:06.640
Who will be my partner?

411
37:17.274 --> 37:18.760
Will Zeng be my partner?

412
37:21.872 --> 37:23.312
Since I might die,

413
37:25.179 --> 37:27.240
I want to die in front of Zeng Klookfoon.

414
37:28.312 --> 37:30.040
It would be my honor.

415
37:31.376 --> 37:32.440
Zeng is not a part of the game.

416
37:34.201 --> 37:35.240
You can’t ask him that.

417
37:37.778 --> 37:38.778
Zeng.

418
37:40.133 --> 37:41.040
Are you scared?

419
38:03.240 --> 38:05.973
If you want to face me, then bring it on.

420
38:14.478 --> 38:15.920
I’ll let you shoot first.

421
38:16.948 --> 38:19.560
If you hit the target, I’ll accept you.

422
38:20.327 --> 38:22.840
If you miss, you will have to leave.

423
38:23.257 --> 38:26.080
Your target is this watermelon seed.

424
38:31.132 --> 38:32.160
You have only one chance.

425
39:01.760 --> 39:02.760
Focus.

426
39:04.571 --> 39:05.611
Stand steady.

427
39:08.769 --> 39:09.769
Wait.

428
39:14.067 --> 39:15.200
You practiced with my gun.

429
39:18.267 --> 39:19.440
Use my gun to shoot.

430
39:48.288 --> 39:49.280
(Don’t be nervous.)

431
39:49.634 --> 39:50.720
(Focus on the target.)

432
39:50.944 --> 39:52.360
(Keep the front and rear sights aligned.)

433
39:52.463 --> 39:53.421
(Keep your arms straight.)

434
40:03.980 --> 40:05.000
(Don’t be afraid.)

435
40:06.122 --> 40:07.160
(Stay focused.)

436
40:37.233 --> 40:38.694
Hey, Yong.

437
40:39.161 --> 40:40.357
You miss it.

438
40:40.705 --> 40:44.801
He misses it. He’s such a loser.

439
40:44.880 --> 40:45.880
I told you.

440
40:46.922 --> 40:48.640
He’s a loser.

441
41:12.473 --> 41:13.673
Good luck, bro.

442
41:14.080 --> 41:15.120
See you around.

443
41:15.404 --> 41:16.404
Yes.

444
41:17.066 --> 41:18.108
Wish you all the best.

445
41:19.179 --> 41:20.179
Yes.

446
41:28.991 --> 41:30.360
I’m leaving. Goodbye.

447
41:33.300 --> 41:35.240
You shouldn’t have wasted your time teaching him.

448
41:36.269 --> 41:39.341
Yong is not good enough to be a part of our gang.

449
42:21.513 --> 42:23.040
I survive.

450
42:23.280 --> 42:24.331
You, take it.

451
42:24.440 --> 42:25.840
It’s your turn. Take it.

452
42:28.319 --> 42:29.127
I can’t do it.

453
42:29.152 --> 42:30.053
I’ll quit.

454
42:42.683 --> 42:44.280
Damn it. I can’t do it.

455
42:55.960 --> 42:56.960
Don’t.

456
43:08.340 --> 43:09.340
Good luck.

457
43:21.663 --> 43:22.680
It’s your turn.

458
43:26.931 --> 43:28.360
Have a nice trip to the other side.

459
43:34.534 --> 43:36.840
I like it here.

460
43:45.353 --> 43:47.164
Do you want me to book a funeral home for you?

461
43:58.100 --> 44:00.280
Hey. Stop it.

462
44:00.615 --> 44:01.840
There are only two shots left.

463
44:02.093 --> 44:03.773
The chances are 50/50.

464
44:07.864 --> 44:09.320
Shall we stop, Zeng?

465
44:10.196 --> 44:11.556
I’ll let you win.

466
44:12.243 --> 44:13.480
Do you think I’m a wimp?

467
44:14.654 --> 44:16.120
I’m just worried about you.

468
44:18.223 --> 44:19.223
Take it.

469
44:50.856 --> 44:52.040
Why don’t you stop here?

470
44:53.150 --> 44:54.268
At least, you won’t die.

471
44:55.321 --> 44:56.480
If I stop,

472
44:57.809 --> 44:59.240
will you accept me into your gang?

473
44:59.589 --> 45:02.440
If you die, you can’t join my gang anyway.

474
45:03.540 --> 45:05.640
Stop it. It doesn’t worth to die for.

475
45:20.251 --> 45:21.520
You said it yourself.

476
45:22.680 --> 45:26.040
When you give your word, you won’t change it.

477
45:51.048 --> 45:52.048
Din! Kheow!

478
45:52.539 --> 45:53.760
What have you done?

479
45:57.196 --> 45:58.280
I’m sorry.

480
46:11.037 --> 46:12.640
You insulted me in front of everyone.

481
46:14.590 --> 46:16.301
Get up. Now.

482
46:20.586 --> 46:21.586
I’m sorry.

483
46:21.713 --> 46:22.960
I took the bullet out.

484
46:23.085 --> 46:24.205
I ordered him to do it.

485
46:24.263 --> 46:26.373
You both did wrong.

486
46:28.124 --> 46:30.680
From now on, how can I trust you?

487
46:30.955 --> 46:31.817
Huh?

488
46:31.919 --> 46:32.919
Hey.

489
46:33.114 --> 46:34.600
They just mean well.

490
46:34.944 --> 46:36.320
If I were them, I would do the same.

491
46:36.501 --> 46:37.621
Don’t butt in.

492
46:38.717 --> 46:43.325
How could they let the gang’s leader risk his life for some random idiot?

493
46:44.128 --> 46:46.360
Did you know that the gun was not loaded?

494
46:46.757 --> 46:47.877
I didn’t know.

495
46:48.938 --> 46:51.440
But I saw you two acting strange.

496
46:52.498 --> 46:56.207
So I took my chances and thought about what I would do if I were them.

497
47:00.474 --> 47:02.040
Where did you get that confidence?

498
47:03.039 --> 47:05.920
If you were wrong, you could have died.

499
47:06.276 --> 47:07.956
Yes, you could have died.

500
47:08.127 --> 47:10.600
But I’m lucky that I wasn’t wrong.

501
47:12.567 --> 47:14.634
Damn, you are out of your mind.

502
47:15.562 --> 47:17.760
I told you. I like this place.

503
47:19.587 --> 47:21.120
This is the place I want to be.

504
47:30.858 --> 47:33.135
So…

505
47:37.060 --> 47:38.280
am I in?

506
48:13.677 --> 48:14.960
You have no place to go?

507
48:18.230 --> 48:19.600
You knew that you could never beat me,

508
48:19.980 --> 48:21.280
but you didn’t give up.

509
48:22.216 --> 48:23.760
You are so stubborn.

510
48:30.483 --> 48:31.483
Fine.

511
48:32.179 --> 48:33.459
I’ll accept you.

512
48:36.400 --> 48:37.560
Sen, what are you looking at?

513
48:42.708 --> 48:43.708
Den.

514
48:43.877 --> 48:45.440
When you first learned to shoot,

515
48:46.932 --> 48:48.480
did you hit the target as Yong did?

516
48:53.319 --> 48:55.080
I don’t accept you for your skills,

517
48:57.655 --> 48:58.952
but I accept you for your spirit.

518
49:00.841 --> 49:02.041
Do you mean it?

519
49:02.910 --> 49:03.910
Yes.

520
49:04.993 --> 49:06.240
Come on. Let’s go back.

521
49:08.671 --> 49:09.671
Den.

522
49:09.881 --> 49:10.881
Wait for me.

523
49:15.464 --> 49:17.440
Last one to finish has to stick a watermelon seed up their nose!

524
49:17.529 --> 49:19.520
Yong, you can’t do that.

525
49:28.348 --> 49:30.778
You can’t beat me in everything, Zoe.

526
49:32.338 --> 49:33.680
If you keep losing to me,

527
49:34.181 --> 49:36.048
how would you face your men?

528
49:36.980 --> 49:37.980
We’ll see.

529
49:40.381 --> 49:41.381
Hands.

530
49:48.060 --> 49:49.060
Ready?

531
49:49.643 --> 49:50.643
Start.

532
49:56.107 --> 49:57.600
Hey, hey, hey.

533
49:57.745 --> 49:58.473
Do it.

534
49:58.498 --> 49:59.840
You can do it.

535
50:00.481 --> 50:01.481
Go.

536
50:02.290 --> 50:04.588
Oh, oh, oh.

537
50:08.626 --> 50:11.351
Oh, oh, oh.

538
50:15.456 --> 50:17.056
Zeng, you can do it.

539
50:18.444 --> 50:19.707
Push it down.

540
50:19.912 --> 50:21.280
Come on.

541
50:24.924 --> 50:28.200
Oh, oh, oh.

542
50:48.152 --> 50:49.152
Oh.

543
50:54.059 --> 50:55.059
Oh.

544
50:55.404 --> 50:56.667
Zeng, you can do it.

545
50:56.692 --> 50:58.130
Oh.

546
50:58.174 --> 50:59.525
Hey, hey, hey.

547
51:16.409 --> 51:17.680
Will it end today?

548
51:18.576 --> 51:19.576
No.

549
51:45.415 --> 51:46.440
Can I sit with you?

550
51:53.999 --> 51:54.999
Yeah.

551
51:58.677 --> 51:59.677
Sen, I…

552
52:05.219 --> 52:07.505
Sen, I don’t want to bother you, but…

553
52:10.290 --> 52:11.567
I want some peace.

554
52:12.178 --> 52:15.197
If you want to sit here, can you be quiet?

555
52:17.978 --> 52:18.978
Yes.

556
52:26.317 --> 52:27.597
Sen, what about…

557
52:46.694 --> 52:48.120
-What are you looking at? -Shh!

558
52:48.518 --> 52:49.518
Be quiet.

559
52:49.566 --> 52:51.360
Yong, are you teasing me?

560
53:09.852 --> 53:12.240
Thank you for helping me.

561
53:30.795 --> 53:32.720
Play it. I want to hear it.

562
54:13.875 --> 54:15.320
I really respect you.

563
54:17.932 --> 54:18.932
Yeah.

564
54:19.039 --> 54:20.039
Thanks.

565
54:23.456 --> 54:25.480
I thought you were like the other two-bit thugs.

566
54:27.340 --> 54:28.600
Now, I get to know you,

567
54:30.021 --> 54:33.080
you don’t disappoint me, Zeng Klookfoon.

568
54:34.291 --> 54:35.971
You are the real deal.

569
54:39.856 --> 54:41.840
Yeah, that’s me.

570
54:42.156 --> 54:43.240
You just realized it now.

571
54:47.001 --> 54:48.361
You make me feel…

572
54:56.210 --> 54:57.210
love.

573
54:59.893 --> 55:00.893
I love you.

574
55:16.532 --> 55:17.532
Yes!

575
55:19.516 --> 55:20.800
I won!

576
55:27.203 --> 55:30.000
I won, but no one saw it.

577
55:31.548 --> 55:32.629
I’m going to get some sleep.

578
55:32.746 --> 55:33.746
Wait.

579
55:36.086 --> 55:37.086
What?

580
55:41.718 --> 55:43.000
This is my handkerchief.

581
55:43.747 --> 55:45.520
It’s a symbol that I accept you.

582
55:58.989 --> 55:59.989
Hey.

583
56:01.672 --> 56:03.880
They said that gifting a handkerchief means we will be parting.

584
56:13.470 --> 56:15.280
I want to be with you for a long time.

585
56:41.731 --> 56:42.960
I’ll have ten bags.

586
56:43.564 --> 56:44.480
It’s sold out.

587
56:44.505 --> 56:45.505
What?

588
56:45.997 --> 56:47.760
Hongsen is going to have withdrawals.

589
56:48.210 --> 56:49.210
Poor him.

590
56:57.994 --> 56:58.994
Here.

591
56:59.971 --> 57:01.720
I’ll give you two bags out of kindness.

592
57:02.524 --> 57:03.724
Here, two bags.

593
57:06.863 --> 57:07.960
I don’t want them.

594
57:08.464 --> 57:11.280
My pride as a gangster is more important than my life.

595
57:14.515 --> 57:15.640
Then you have to endure the withdrawals.

596
57:16.114 --> 57:17.114
Fine.

597
57:17.329 --> 57:18.310
What about your boss?

598
57:18.410 --> 57:19.690
He will be fine.

599
57:22.512 --> 57:23.520
He said he didn’t want it.

600
57:24.208 --> 57:25.800
Pride doesn’t feed you,

601
57:27.449 --> 57:28.440
but it sure looks cool.

602
57:39.234 --> 57:41.234
Hong, don’t you have any left?

603
57:41.298 --> 57:43.640
He agreed to give it to you. Why didn’t you take it?

604
57:45.604 --> 57:46.655
It doesn’t look cool.

605
57:55.002 --> 57:57.480
Yong, I cut Hongsen off a long time ago.

606
57:57.579 --> 57:58.680
Why do you ask for his help?

607
57:58.722 --> 58:01.880
But now I want to know why you and he stopped being friends.

608
58:02.683 --> 58:04.120
Hongsen killed Dad.

609
58:05.992 --> 58:07.272
Can I trust you?

610
58:08.168 --> 58:10.920
If I can trust you, you can trust me.

611
58:12.956 --> 58:14.560
Zoe, listen to me.

612
58:14.978 --> 58:18.600
Even if no one sees your worth, you still have me.

613
58:18.897 --> 58:21.440
Since he joined our gang, he sneaks out every morning.

614
58:22.178 --> 58:23.686
Did you check his background?

615
58:24.673 --> 58:25.680
What are you doing?

616
58:25.680 --> 58:26.680
MkvDrama.net
